{"html":"<span id=\"06-循环结构\" class=\"article-title-anchor\"></span>\n<p>Java 中的循环结构用于重复执行某段代码，直到满足特定条件。Java 提供了多种循环结构，包括 <code>for</code> 循环、<code>while</code> 循环、<code>do-while</code> 循环以及增强的 <code>for-each</code> 循环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-循环结构的类型\">1. 循环结构的类型</h2>\n<h3 id=\"1-for-循环\">(1) <code>for</code> 循环</h3>\n<p><code>for</code> 循环用于在已知循环次数的情况下重复执行代码。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>java</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (初始化; 条件; 更新) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 循环体</span>\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">i</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>; i &lt; <span class=\"hljs-number\">5</span>; i++) {\n    System.out.println(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;i 的值: &quot;</span> + i);\n}\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p><strong>明确循环变量名</strong>：使用有意义的变量名（如 <code>index</code> 而不是 <code>i</code>），尤其是在嵌套循环中。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>避免修改循环变量</strong>：不要在循环体内修改循环变量（如 <code>i++</code>），除非有特殊需求。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>减少循环内部的计算</strong>：将循环内部不变的计算提取到循环外部。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"2-while-循环\">(2) <code>while</code> 循环</h3>\n<p><code>while</code> 循环用于在条件为 <code>true</code> 时重复执行代码。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>java</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">while</span> (条件) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 循环体</span>\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">i</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">while</span> (i &lt; <span class=\"hljs-number\">5</span>) {\n    System.out.println(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;i 的值: &quot;</span> + i);\n    i++;\n}\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"最佳实践-1\">最佳实践</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p><strong>避免死循环</strong>：确保循环条件最终会变为 <code>false</code>，否则会导致死循环。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>明确退出条件</strong>：在循环开始前明确退出条件，避免逻辑混乱。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>使用 <code>break</code> 或 <code>continue</code> 谨慎</strong>：过度使用 <code>break</code> 或 <code>continue</code> 会降低代码可读性。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"3-do-while-循环\">(3) <code>do-while</code> 循环</h3>\n<p><code>do-while</code> 循环与 <code>while</code> 循环类似，但它的循环体至少会执行一次，然后再检查条件。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>java</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">do</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 循环体</span>\n} <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">while</span> (条件);\n\n<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">i</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">do</span> {\n    System.out.println(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;i 的值: &quot;</span> + i);\n    i++;\n} <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">while</span> (i &lt; <span class=\"hljs-number\">5</span>);\n\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"最佳实践-2\">最佳实践</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p><strong>适用于至少执行一次的场景</strong>：如用户输入验证。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>避免滥用</strong>：如果不需要至少执行一次，优先使用 <code>while</code> 循环。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"4-增强的-for-each-循环\">4. 增强的 <code>for-each</code> 循环</h2>\n<p><code>for-each</code> 循环用于遍历数组或集合，语法简洁。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>java</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (数据类型 变量 : 数组或集合) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// 循环体</span>\n}\n<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span>[] <span class=\"hljs-variable\">numbers</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> {<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">4</span>, <span class=\"hljs-number\">5</span>};\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> num : numbers) {\n    System.out.println(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;数字: &quot;</span> + num);\n}\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"最佳实践-3\">最佳实践</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p><strong>遍历集合或数组</strong>：优先使用 <code>for-each</code> 循环，代码更简洁。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>避免修改集合</strong>：在 <code>for-each</code> 循环中不要修改集合（如删除元素），否则会抛出 <code>ConcurrentModificationException</code>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>需要索引时使用普通 <code>for</code> 循环</strong>：如果需要访问索引，使用普通 <code>for</code> 循环。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"5-嵌套循环\">5. 嵌套循环</h2>\n<p>嵌套循环是指在一个循环内部再嵌套另一个循环。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-block-bar\"><span>java</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"code-copy\" data-action=\"copy\">复制</button></div><pre tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"hljs language-java\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">i</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>; i &lt; <span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span>; i++) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">for</span> (<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">j</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>; j &lt; <span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span>; j++) {\n        System.out.println(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;i = &quot;</span> + i + <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;, j = &quot;</span> + j);\n    }\n}\n</code></pre></div>\n<h4 id=\"最佳实践-4\">最佳实践</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p><strong>避免过深嵌套</strong>：嵌套层次过多会降低代码可读性，尽量控制在 2-3 层。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>提取内层循环</strong>：如果内层循环逻辑复杂，可以将其提取为一个独立的方法。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>优化性能</strong>：尽量减少内层循环的计算量，避免重复计算。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"6-循环控制语句\">6. 循环控制语句</h2>\n<h3 id=\"1-break\">(1) <code>break</code></h3>\n<p>用于立即退出循环。</p>\n<h3 id=\"2-continue\">(2) <code>continue</code></h3>\n<p>用于跳过当前迭代，直接进入下一次迭代。</p>\n","toc":[{"level":2,"text":"1. 循环结构的类型","id":"1-循环结构的类型"},{"level":3,"text":"(1) for 循环","id":"1-for-循环"},{"level":3,"text":"(2) while 循环","id":"2-while-循环"},{"level":3,"text":"(3) do-while 循环","id":"3-do-while-循环"},{"level":2,"text":"4. 增强的 for-each 循环","id":"4-增强的-for-each-循环"},{"level":2,"text":"5. 嵌套循环","id":"5-嵌套循环"},{"level":2,"text":"6. 循环控制语句","id":"6-循环控制语句"},{"level":3,"text":"(1) break","id":"1-break"},{"level":3,"text":"(2) continue","id":"2-continue"}]}